{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27316","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 崔郾","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"存亡去住一壶中，兄事安期弟葛洪。\n甲子已过千岁鹤，仪容方称十年童。\n心灵暗合行人数，药力潜均造化功。\n终待此身无系累，武陵山下等黄公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔郾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}